向，曰「齊政歸田氏。」叔向曰：「晉公室卑。」"},{"id":"shiji-014-r303-c04-m001","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"叔向","person_id":"edm_4zm_yh1","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本格國別、事件與本篇時間範圍核讀的完整名字暫定同指；非全域字串配對，省稱與世襲稱號另行核讀。","table_id":"shiji-014","table_fragment_id":"shiji-014-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-014-r303","table_cell_id":"shiji-014-r303-c04","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-014","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-014","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-014","source_revision":"2607001","kind":"table_person_mention","quote":"九晏嬰使晉，見叔向，曰「齊政歸田氏。」叔向曰：「晉公室卑。」"}],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji032-089","person_id":"edm_4zm_yh1","surfaces":["叔向"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-031-wu","c-shiji-032-qi"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p014","quote":"適晉，説趙文子、韓宣子、魏獻子曰：「晉國其萃於三家乎！」將去，謂叔向曰：「吾子勉之！君侈而多良，大夫皆富，政將在三家。吾子直，必思自免於難。」"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p067","quote":"九年，景公使晏嬰之晉，與叔向私語曰：「齊政卒歸田氏。田氏雖無大德，以公權私，有德於民，民愛之。」十二年，景公如晉，見平公，欲與伐燕。十八年，公復如晉，見昭公。二十六年，獵魯郊，因入魯，與晏嬰俱問魯禮。三十一年，魯昭公辟季氏難，奔齊。齊欲以千社封之，子家止昭公，昭公乃請齊伐魯，取鄆以居昭公。"}],"rationale":"按齊君繼位、家族明示與田氏政變的具體敘事暫定異稱。晉／魯昭公、齊／吳公子光分開，鮑子、鮑牧及監止、子我暫不合併，所錄或曰及疑讀仍待版本覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji039-091","person_id":"edm_4zm_yh1","surfaces":["叔向"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-031-wu","c-shiji-039-jin"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p014","quote":"適晉，説趙文子、韓宣子、魏獻子曰：「晉國其萃於三家乎！」將去，謂叔向曰：「吾子勉之！君侈而多良，大夫皆富，政將在三家。吾子直，必思自免於難。」"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p122","quote":"十九年，齊使晏嬰如晉，與叔向語。叔向曰：「晉，季世也。公厚賦爲臺池而不恤政，政在私門，其可久乎！」晏子然之。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與稱號、晉世系與具體事件暫定所列提及同指；附各段原文，未按同字短名全域合併；紀年與版本差異待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p014","text":"適晉，説趙文子、韓宣子、魏獻子曰：「晉國其萃於三家乎！」將去，謂叔向曰：「吾子勉之！君侈而多良，大夫皆富，政將在三家。吾子直，必思自免於難。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m014-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"趙文子","kind":"person","person_id":"46e_c85_fft","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m014-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"韓宣子","kind":"person","person_id":"4e7_nix_4rh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m014-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"魏獻子","kind":"person","person_id":"8f2_m4v_3el","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m014-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"三家","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、族稱或未定指代；有虞等不直接補作熟知個人，仍待覆核。"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m014-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"叔向","kind":"person","person_id":"edm_4zm_yh1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m014-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"三家","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、族稱或未定指代；有虞等不直接補作熟知個人，仍待覆核。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","book_id":"b-shiji-031","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-031-wu"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p067","text":"九年，景公使晏嬰之晉，與叔向私語曰：「齊政卒歸田氏。田氏雖無大德，以公權私，有德於民，民愛之。」十二年，景公如晉，見平公，欲與伐燕。十八年，公復如晉，見昭公。二十六年，獵魯郊，因入魯，與晏嬰俱問魯禮。三十一年，魯昭公辟季氏難，奔齊。齊欲以千社封之，子家止昭公，昭公乃請齊伐魯，取鄆以居昭公。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m067-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"wuz_yxe_b9k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m067-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"晏嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"jcn_rp4_qap","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m067-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"叔向","kind":"person","person_id":"edm_4zm_yh1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m067-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"wuz_yxe_b9k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m067-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"平公","kind":"perso